      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "May 2024 Sun Mon Tue Wed Thu Fri Sat 1 2 3 4 5 6 7 8 9 Community Preview - Jee...* Community Preview - Jee...* May 9, 2024  7:30 pm - 10:00 pm Preview Night Dinner is unavailable before the performance. General seating in the theatre.COMIC ADVENTURE – Adapted by Margaret Raether MAY 10 —JUN 2 Set sail for laughter as Bertie Wooster revels in life aboard the Vanderley yacht, accompanied, as always, by his peerless valet, Jeeves. When Bertie's pal Crumpet assaults a prince, a madcap case of mistaken identities ensues surely leading to Bertie's doom - or worse, his marriage? Have no fear, Jeeves will sort it out, or will he? See more details • 10 Jeeves at Sea Jeeves at Sea May 10, 2024  8:00 pm - 10:30 pm COMIC ADVENTURE  — Adapted by Margaret Raether MAY 10 — JUN 2   Set sail for laughter as Bertie Wooster revels in life aboard the Vanderley yacht, accompanied, as always, by his peerless valet, Jeeves. When Bertie's pal Crumpet assaults a prince, a madcap case of mistaken identities ensues surely leading to Bertie's doom - or worse, his marriage? Have no fear, Jeeves will sort it out, or will he? See more details • 11 Jeeves at Sea* Jeeves at Sea* May 11, 2024  2:00 pm - 4:30 pm Lunch is unavailable before the matinee.COMIC ADVENTURE  — Adapted by Margaret Raether MAY 10 — JUN 2 Set sail for laughter as Bertie Wooster revels in life aboard the Vanderley yacht, accompanied, as always, by his peerless valet, Jeeves. When Bertie's pal Crumpet assaults a prince, a madcap case of mistaken identities ensues surely leading to Bertie's doom - or worse, his marriage? Have no fear, Jeeves will sort […]"
